            "question": "WHAT IS CREATINE?",
            "answer": "<p>Creatine is a natural compound found in your muscles and brain. It helps produce energy (ATP) during exercise, supporting strength, power, and recovery. Supplementing with creatine monohydrate provides more of what your body needs to perform at its best.<br/> </p>"
