          "settings": {
            "question": "WILL CREATINE MAKE ME BULKY?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Creatine helps support lean muscle growth by fueling your workouts and hydrating your muscles, but it won’t cause unwanted bulk. It supports natural strength and performance—how your body responds depends on your training style and nutrition.<br/></p>"
